# brainless public engine repo

# Secrets and credentials
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*service_account*
*_token.json
*.credentials.json
.env

# Privacy: personal identity, health and official documents anywhere in the tree
**/Official Docs/
**/* - Health/
**/*Passport*
**/*Pasaport*
**/Security Incidents/

# Machine noise
.DS_Store
venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.obsidian/workspace*.json

# --- never absorb vault content ---
Work/*
Personal/*
Library/*
Inbox/*
raw/*
Archive/*
Daily Briefings/*
Thinking/**/*.md
.wiki/summaries/*
.wiki/articles/*
.wiki/ideas/*
.wiki/digests/*
.wiki/projects/*
.wiki/moc/*
.wiki/entities/*
.wiki/relationships/*
.wiki/INDEX.md
_Agent-Context/*.md
!_Agent-Context/AGENT-RULES.md
!_Agent-Context/TRUNK-BASED-DEVELOPMENT.md
!_Agent-Context/PROFILE.md
!**/.gitkeep
logs/*
.agents/state/*
